DESCRIPTION:Step into the brand-new Heritage Center Theater for Reels of Reflection! Enjoy a screening of South & Saints\, a moving & humorous stage production\, complete with a bag of popcorn and an opportunity to stay afterward for engaging conversation and community connection.
