UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventamotownchristmas20746-20261121@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261116T201549Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261121
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261122
SUMMARY:A Motown Christmas
DESCRIPTION:The Music & Magic of Motown Celebrate the season with A Motown Christmas \, a high-energy holiday spectacular featuring legendary vocalists from The Miracles and The Contours. Backed by a dynamic six-piece band\, these icons deliver powerful performances of timeless Motown hits and holiday classics\, all wrapped in lush harmonies and captivating choreography. Perfect for the whole family\, this festive concert invites audiences to sing\, dance\, and relive the golden age of soul music while embracing the warmth and joy of the holidays. Whether you’re a long-time Motown fan or discovering the magic of Motown music for the first time\, A Motown Christmas guarantees a night of celebration\, nostalgia\, and heart. Learn more about A Motown Christmas on the official website.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/a-motown-christmas/20746/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventart26architecturewalkingtour22070-20261121@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261116T201549Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261121
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261122
SUMMARY:Art & Architecture Walking Tour
DESCRIPTION:Look at Frederick with new eyes. Experience the history and beauty of downtown as we explore some of the popular architectural styles\, local art\, and history. *Tour starts at the Museum of Frederick County History\, 24 East Church Street\, Frederick\, MD 21701 Length: 90 minutes\, about 1 mile
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/art-%26-architecture-walking-tour/22070/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventthecratersisterschristmasspecial25835-20261121@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261116T201549Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261121
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261122
SUMMARY:The Crater Sisters' Christmas Special
DESCRIPTION:When the entire cast and crew quit thirty minutes before her comeback special\, a diva is forced to reunite with the sister she’s not spoken to in three decades. A zany\, musical romp filled with ghosts\, wonder\, delusion\, and the magic of the holidays! Created in part by MET Ensemble Member\, Lori Boyd. THE CRATER SISTERS’ CHRISTMAS SPECIAL BY JOHN MOROGIELLO AND LORI BOYD DIRECTED BY LYNN SHAPR SPEARS MUSIC DIRECTED BY MELYNDA BURDETTE WINTROL CHOREOGRAPHED BY JULIE HERBER NOVEMBER 20 – DECEMBER 20
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/the-crater-sisters-christmas-special/25835/
END:VEVENT
